        "symbol": "◆◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The angazhani rushes up to a foe at extreme speed and slams down with their fists. The angazhani Strides or Climbs up to three times, then makes two fist Strikes against one enemy within reach."
      ]
